# DeepSeek
deepseek.com = server:https://dns.alidns.com/dns-query,https://doh.pub/dns-query
*.deepseek.com = server:https://dns.alidns.com/dns-query,https://doh.pub/dns-query

# Domestic Qianwen and Tongyi; qwen.ai is excluded
